*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"

*%============================================================
*% Brother QL-800 - Native ARM64 CUPS Driver
*% Supports: 62mm die-cut and continuous DK labels
*%============================================================

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion:   "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "QL800.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(Brother QL-800)"
*ModelName: "QL-800"
*ShortNickName: "Brother QL-800"
*NickName: "Brother QL-800 (ARM64)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90

*% CUPS-specific
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertoql"
*cupsLanguages: "en"

*% ============================================================
*% Resolution
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 5 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ============================================================
*% Media Types
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Label Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: DK22206
*MediaType DK22206/DK-22206 (62mm Continuous White): ""
*MediaType DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): ""
*MediaType DK11209/DK-11209 (62mm x 29mm Die-Cut): ""
*MediaType DK11202/DK-11202 (62mm x 100mm Die-Cut): ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% ============================================================
*% Auto Cut
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *AutoCut/Auto Cut: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *AutoCut
*DefaultAutoCut: True
*AutoCut True/Every Label and at End: ""
*AutoCut EndOnly/At End of Job Only: ""
*AutoCut False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *AutoCut

*% ============================================================
*% Horizontal Adjust — positive moves the print to the right
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *HorizontalAdjust/Horizontal Adjust: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 25 AnySetup *HorizontalAdjust
*DefaultHorizontalAdjust: None
*HorizontalAdjust Minus3/3mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Minus2/2mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Minus1/1mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust None/None: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus1/1mm Right: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus2/2mm Right: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus3/3mm Right: ""
*CloseUI: *HorizontalAdjust

*% ============================================================
*% Label Scale — shrinks the whole label before trimming it to the
*% printable area (about 6mm top/bottom and 1.5mm sides on die-cut labels
*% cannot be printed).  Leave the app's own Scale at 100%.
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *LabelScale/Label Scale: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 26 AnySetup *LabelScale
*DefaultLabelScale: 98
*LabelScale 100/100%: ""
*LabelScale 98/98%: ""
*LabelScale 96/96%: ""
*LabelScale 95/95%: ""
*LabelScale 92/92%: ""
*LabelScale 90/90%: ""
*LabelScale Fit/Fit Printable Area: ""
*CloseUI: *LabelScale

*% ============================================================
*% Print Quality — sets the printer's "quality priority" flag
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *PrintQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 27 AnySetup *PrintQuality
*DefaultPrintQuality: Quality
*PrintQuality Quality/Best Quality (slower): ""
*PrintQuality Speed/Faster Printing: ""
*CloseUI: *PrintQuality

*% ============================================================
*% Halftone / Brightness / Contrast — the page arrives as 8-bit grey
*% and rastertoql converts it to black and white
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *Halftone/Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *Halftone
*DefaultHalftone: ErrorDiffusion
*Halftone Binary/For Logos and Text: ""
*Halftone Dither/For Text and Graphics: ""
*Halftone ErrorDiffusion/For Labels Containing Images: ""
*CloseUI: *Halftone

*OpenUI *Brightness/Brightness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *Brightness
*DefaultBrightness: 0
*Brightness -20/-20: ""
*Brightness -15/-15: ""
*Brightness -10/-10: ""
*Brightness -5/-5: ""
*Brightness 0/0: ""
*Brightness 5/+5: ""
*Brightness 10/+10: ""
*Brightness 15/+15: ""
*Brightness 20/+20: ""
*CloseUI: *Brightness

*OpenUI *Contrast/Contrast: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *Contrast
*DefaultContrast: 0
*Contrast -20/-20: ""
*Contrast -15/-15: ""
*Contrast -10/-10: ""
*Contrast -5/-5: ""
*Contrast 0/0: ""
*Contrast 5/+5: ""
*Contrast 10/+10: ""
*Contrast 15/+15: ""
*Contrast 20/+20: ""
*CloseUI: *Contrast

*% ============================================================
*% Page Sizes
*% ============================================================

*% --- Continuous: DK-22206 / DK-22205 62mm wide ---
*% 62mm = 175.6pt, default length 200mm = 567pt
*DefaultPaperDimension: DK22206
*DefaultImageableArea: DK22206
*PaperDimension DK22206/DK-22206 (62mm Continuous White): "175.68 567"
*ImageableArea  DK22206/DK-22206 (62mm Continuous White): "0 0 175.68 567"

*PaperDimension DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "175.68 567"
*ImageableArea  DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "0 0 175.68 567"

*% --- Die-cut: DK-11209 62mm x 29mm ---
*PaperDimension DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "175.68 82.08"
*ImageableArea  DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "0 0 175.68 82.08"

*% --- Die-cut: DK-11202 62mm x 100mm ---
*PaperDimension DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "175.68 283.44"
*PaperDimension C62x29/62mm Continuous, 29mm cut: "175.68 81.84"
*PaperDimension C62x100/62mm Continuous, 100mm cut: "175.68 283.46"
*PaperDimension CSmallAddress/Small Address Label (62x29mm, continuous): "175.68 81.84"
*PaperDimension CShipping/Shipping Label (62x100mm, continuous): "175.68 282.96"
*PaperDimension CNameBadge/Name Badge Label (62x100mm, continuous): "175.68 282.96"
*PaperDimension CBinder5cm/Binder 5 cm Spine (62x209mm, continuous): "175.68 592.32"
*PaperDimension CPostage184/Postage Label 62x184mm (continuous): "175.68 521.28"
*PaperDimension CPostage209/Postage Label 62x209mm (continuous): "175.68 593.28"
*ImageableArea  DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "0 0 175.68 283.44"
*ImageableArea  C62x29/62mm Continuous, 29mm cut: "0 0 175.68 81.84"
*ImageableArea  C62x100/62mm Continuous, 100mm cut: "0 0 175.68 283.46"
*ImageableArea  CSmallAddress/Small Address Label (62x29mm, continuous): "0 0 175.68 81.84"
*ImageableArea  CShipping/Shipping Label (62x100mm, continuous): "0 0 175.68 282.96"
*ImageableArea  CNameBadge/Name Badge Label (62x100mm, continuous): "0 0 175.68 282.96"
*ImageableArea  CBinder5cm/Binder 5 cm Spine (62x209mm, continuous): "0 0 175.68 592.32"
*ImageableArea  CPostage184/Postage Label 62x184mm (continuous): "0 0 175.68 521.28"
*ImageableArea  CPostage209/Postage Label 62x209mm (continuous): "0 0 175.68 593.28"

*% Custom sizes: fixed 62mm width, free length (continuous roll)
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "175.68"
*MaxMediaHeight: "2834.65"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 175.68 175.68
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 36 2834.65
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: DK22206
*PageSize DK22206/DK-22206 (62mm Continuous White): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 82.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 283.44]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize C62x29/62mm Continuous, 29mm cut: "<</PageSize[175.68 81.84]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize C62x100/62mm Continuous, 100mm cut: "<</PageSize[175.68 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CSmallAddress/Small Address Label (62x29mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 81.84]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CShipping/Shipping Label (62x100mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 282.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CNameBadge/Name Badge Label (62x100mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 282.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CBinder5cm/Binder 5 cm Spine (62x209mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 592.32]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CPostage184/Postage Label 62x184mm (continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 521.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CPostage209/Postage Label 62x209mm (continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 593.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: DK22206
*PageRegion DK22206/DK-22206 (62mm Continuous White): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 82.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 283.44]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion C62x29/62mm Continuous, 29mm cut: "<</PageSize[175.68 81.84]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion C62x100/62mm Continuous, 100mm cut: "<</PageSize[175.68 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CSmallAddress/Small Address Label (62x29mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 81.84]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CShipping/Shipping Label (62x100mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 282.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CNameBadge/Name Badge Label (62x100mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 282.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CBinder5cm/Binder 5 cm Spine (62x209mm, continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 592.32]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CPostage184/Postage Label 62x184mm (continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 521.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CPostage209/Postage Label 62x209mm (continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 593.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% ============================================================
*% CUPS Raster settings — 1-bit K, 300dpi
*% ============================================================

*% ============================================================
*% Constraints
*% ============================================================
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22206 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22206 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK22206
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK22205
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK22206
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK22205

*% ============================================================
*% End of PPD
*% ============================================================
